      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Conscious AI is far less likely than it seems, but seeming-conscious AI is already here and poses its own dangers.",
      "question": "Conscious AI — why is real machine consciousness unlikely, and what should we do about machines that merely seem conscious? (an argued essay)",
      "sourceHeading": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI"
