      "title": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "We are drawn to think AI is conscious by mistaking intelligence for consciousness, by human biases, by loaded language, and by exponential hype and techno-rapture.",
      "question": "Conscious AI — why are we so tempted to believe in it? (a set of psychological biases)",
      "sourceHeading": "The Temptations Of Conscious AI"
    },
