      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-d89xf7"
      ],
      "title": "What (Not) To Do?",
      "gist": "Since nobody knows what makes consciousness, we should not try to build it, and should guard against machines that merely seem conscious, which are much closer.",
      "question": "Conscious AI — what follows for how we should act under uncertainty? (a recommendation)",
      "sourceHeading": "What (Not) To Do?"
    },
    "n0134": {
      "id": "n0134",
      "depth": 2,
      "parent": "n0133",
      "children": [
