        "n0140"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-vs0vpj"
      ],
      "title": "Uncertainty and Ethical Duty",
      "gist": "Moral standing rests on consciousness, and since every theory is uncertain, nobody should deliberately build conscious AI, and other technologies like brain organoids deserve more worry than chatbots."
    },
