      "range": [
        "spya-mxxutn",
        "spya-d89xf7"
      ],
      "title": "False Positives Over Negatives",
      "gist": "Though we have wrongly denied moral status to animals before, our biases with AI more likely produce false positives, since AI resembles us in irrelevant ways."
    },
